Detects rapid geolocation or IP switching (stolen credentials in use).

index=auth OR index=o365
| sort 0 user _time
| streamstats current=f last(_time) as prev_time last(src_ip) as prev_ip by user
| eval time_diff=_time - prev_time
| where time_diff < 3600 AND src_ip != prev_ip
| table user src_ip prev_ip _time time_diff
